; A frame, drawn without a window.
;
; The engine renders into a Framebuffer.offscreen with no SDL behind it, which
; is how every rendering test in this repository works -- Renderer.draw_frame
; is pure array writes. So a picture of what the overlay looks like needs no
; window, no display and no permission to synthesise input at one: a script of
; frames goes in and pixels come out.
;
; A directory of its own, and one level down from the build root, for the two
; reasons studio/ had them. Its own because it is preprocessed and dune's check
; context is per directory. One level down because Camlcast.Asset looks beside
; the executable and one above it, and the font lives in assets/.
;
; Attached to no package: `dune build` compiles it, nothing installs it.

(executable
 (name capture)
 (modules capture)
 (preprocess
  (pps ppx_camlcast))
 (libraries camlcast camlcast_core camlcast_edit camlcast_loom))
